Package: offlineatlas
Type: Package
Title: Standalone Offline Maps and Networks
Version: 0.0.10
Authors@R: person("Keith A.", "Preble", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "preblek25@ecu.edu")
Description: Prepares geographic and schematic networks and area maps as
    standalone HTML files. A shared browser renderer supports filtering,
    selection, and local figure and data downloads without a server.
    Includes fictional aid, Florentine family, World Bank, and FDI examples.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: jsonlite, xml2, grid, sf (>= 1.0-0), ggplot2 (>= 3.5.0)
Suggests: knitr, rmarkdown
VignetteBuilder: knitr
URL: https://github.com/preblek/offlineatlas
BugReports: https://github.com/preblek/offlineatlas/issues
